# estate-guard allow-list: <repo>/<glob><TAB><reason>
# Every exemption names why the match is not residue. Historical records keep the
# words they were written with; current instructions, code and pins are never exempt.
project/docs/adr/**	decision records are historical; superseded ADRs keep their original wording
project/docs/archive/**	archived documentation
project/docs/engineering/vault-migration-coverage-*	dated coverage report of a retired command
project/crates/vault/tests/golden/**	immutable golden fixtures (crates/vault/tests/golden/README.md)
visionGraph/docs/adr/**	decision records are historical
visionGraph/docs/migration-2026-09-22/**	dated migration record
visionGraph/docs/PUBLICATION-contract.md	self-declared historical closeout (line 4)
visionGraph/planning/**/evidence/**	dated research evidence
vowl-wasm/CHANGELOG.md	release history
vowl-wasm/docs/adr/**	decision records are historical
loom/docs/design/ADR-*	decision records are historical
loom/docs/research/**	dated research evidence
loom/uplift-results/**	dated evaluation output
agentbox/docs/adr/**	decision records are historical
agentbox/docs/estate-closeout/**	dated closeout record
agentbox/CHANGELOG.md	release history
VisionFlow/docs/adr/**	decision records are historical
VisionFlow/docs/estate-closeout/**	dated closeout record
VisionFlow/docs/estate-review/**	dated review record
knowledgeGraph/archive/**	logseq-era archive
